Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.63,0:00:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm very excited to be here tonight\N♪ 今晚能来到这里我无比激动 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.13,0:00:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a really, really fun show for you\N♪ 我们为你们准备了超精彩的演出 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.58,0:00:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you guys ready for a party or for what?\N♪ 你们准备好狂欢了吗？ ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.81,0:00:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, let's do it\N♪ 来吧，让我们开始 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.61,0:00:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Double clap if you wanna it\N♪ 一起双击掌 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.95,0:00:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Woo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.80,0:00:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Ladies\N♪ 女士们 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.80,0:00:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Moonlight\N♪ 皎洁月光 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.85,0:00:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Starlite\N♪ 璀璨星光 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.23,0:00:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,All night\N♪ 彻夜相伴 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.73,0:00:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Moonlight\N♪ 皎洁月光 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.17,0:00:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Starlight\N♪ 璀璨星光 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.63,0:00:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,All night\N♪ 彻夜相伴 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.68,0:00:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, dance with me\N♪ 来吧，与我共舞 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.15,0:00:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm levitating\N♪ 我飘飘欲仙 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.45,0:01:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,If you wanna run away with me, I know a galaxy\N♪ 若你想与我私奔 我知道一个星系 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.75,0:01:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And I can take you for a ride\N♪ 我能带你去那里遨游兜风 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.19,0:01:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a premonition that we fell into a rhythm\N♪ 预感我们将沉浸于这节奏 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.00,0:01:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the music don't stop for life\N♪ 音乐不息 生命不止 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.63,0:01:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Glitter in the sky, glitter in my eyes\N♪ 天际璀璨 映于我眸 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.18,0:01:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Shining just the way I like\N♪ 闪耀如我所愿 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.21,0:01:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're feeling like you need a little bit of company\N♪ 若你此刻需要陪伴 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.90,0:01:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You met me at the perfect time\N♪ 你我在最完美的时间相遇 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.60,0:01:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You want me, I want you, baby\N♪ 你渴望我 我亦需要你 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.63,0:01:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,My sugarboo, I'm levitating\N♪ 我的甜心 我飘飘欲仙 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.05,0:01:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The Milky Way, we're renegading\N♪ 我们将一同逃离银河系 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.03,0:01:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.98,0:01:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I got you, moonlight, you're my starlight\N♪ 你是我的月光 独一无二的星光 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.55,0:01:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you all night, come on, dance with me\N♪ 我整夜都需要你 来与我共舞吧 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.84,0:01:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm levitating\N♪ 我飘飘欲仙 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.66,0:01:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You, moonlight, you're my starlight\N♪ 你是我的月光 独一无二的星光 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.91,0:01:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you all night, come on, dance with me\N♪ 我整夜都需要你 来与我共舞吧 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.93,0:01:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm levitating\N♪ 我飘飘欲仙 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.48,0:01:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe that you're for me, I feel it in our energy\N♪ 我坚信你属于我 能量已诉说明晰 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.48,0:01:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I see us written in the stars\N♪ 我们的名字刻于星辰 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.13,0:01:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We can go wherever, so let's do it now or never\N♪ 我们可以去任何地方 此刻莫再犹豫 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.11,0:02:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Baby, nothing's ever, ever too far\N♪ 亲爱的 没有什么是遥不可及 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.26,0:02:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Glitter in the sky, glitter in our eyes\N♪ 天际璀璨 映于你我双眸 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.71,0:02:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Shining just the way we are\N♪ 闪耀如我们本真模样 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.88,0:02:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like we're forever every time we get together\N♪ 每次相聚都恍若永恒 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.46,0:02:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But whatever, let's get lost on Mars\N♪ 但无论如何 让我们在火星恣意流浪 ♪
